# Render a real terminal GIF of the demo:
#   vhs docs/demo.tape        # https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs
# Produces docs/demo.gif (the SVG at docs/demo.svg is the no-tooling fallback).
Output docs/demo.gif
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1200
Set Height 940
Set Theme "Monokai Extended"
Set Padding 20

Type "keeptrue demo"
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 5s
